    airo:evidenceText "[953] When Snapchat introduced a Bob Marley filter on April, 20, 2016, a lot of people pushed back and said the filter was (a) racist and (b) specifically disrespectful to Marley's legacy." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "953" .

